  m_text: The Crypt Awaits\n\nYou descend into an ancient crypt seeking enlightenment.
    Fight through corridors of the undead, collect what the fallen leave behind,
    and face the guardian that stands between you and the Gates of Heaven.\n\nControls\nWASD
    - Move     Mouse - Aim     Left Click - Attack     Space - Jump     Esc - Pause\n\nObjective\nLevel
    1 - Slay all zombies, collect the key, and reach the exit.\nLevel 2 - Defeat
    the guardian, take the key, and ascend to Heaven.
